Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好烂喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有保险时   我可以被车撞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I had insurance, I could get hit by a bus...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是被火烧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or catch on fire, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都无所谓   现在却得小心了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it wouldn't matter. Now I gotta be careful?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜   被火烧这种事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, man. There's never a good time to have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:06:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停了总是不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...stop catching on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得找工作了  我去见经纪人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I guess I gotta go get a job. I'm gonna see my agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过马路要小心左右来车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, make sure to look both ways before you cross the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"过马路要小心左右来车"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Make sure to look both ways before you cross the street."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   菲比  你还活着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, Pheebs, you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等死好累啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's so exhausting, waiting for death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了   你能不能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, by the way, do you think you--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在替你做心理   你没有以为我死了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was preparing you for-Didn't you think I was dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我装得不像吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did that not come off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真像啊  吓死我了  我还以为我们永别了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, scared the hell out of me. I thought we'd lost you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.25,0:07:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你要不要睡下  好  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, you wanna lie down? Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  帮我一个忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And listen, can you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两个小时后叫我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Could you just wake me up in a couple hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果还能叫得醒的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你摆回去的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you take these back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是  我很喜欢  就去买了一对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No-no, I-I just, I liked them so much that I went out and bought some for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很好看  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, they're really great, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love them. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想耍诈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗   课上得怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello. Hey, how'd the lecture go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很顺利啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It went great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既不需要笑话   也不需要裸女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I didn't need any jokes or naked chicks either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  抱歉之前没有好好帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's great. I'm sorry we weren't supportive before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道   教材充实最重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I knew all I had to do was let the material speak for itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都说  "你得表现的既风趣又性感"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everyone's all, uh, "Ross, you have to be funny and sexy."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我证明他们错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I proved them wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就去告诉乔伊和钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And now I'm gonna pass the news on to Joey and Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说你既不风趣也不性感   没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That you're not funny or sexy? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（伊斯特李奥纳德经纪公司）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊斯特  听着  哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Estelle, listen-Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:08:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊崔比亚尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey Tribbiani.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.08,0:09:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回来了  是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you came back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都以为走比较好  但最后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They think they can do better, but they all...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不都爬回来求伊斯特\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...come crawling back to Estelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哪有离开  你一直是我的经纪人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never left you. You've always been my agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没恶意   你别在意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, no harm, no foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊斯特  你得帮我找工作  我的医保没了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Estelle, you gotta get me some work. I lost my health insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  首先我们得做伤害控制\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, first thing we gotta do: damage control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  我觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Well, I think, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能有人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...someone out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在到处中伤你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...may have been bad-mouthing you all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.29,0:09:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天伊斯特帮我排了一堆试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Estelle lined up a bunch of auditions for me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很快就能重新加入医保\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'll have my health insurance back in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:10:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  但你现在应该去蹲马桶吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great, but shouldn't you be on the toilet right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才举哑铃时  肚子突然一阵剧痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I got this blinding pain in my stomach when I was lifting weights before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就昏倒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then I, uh, passed out...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且一直就站不起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and, uh, I haven't been able to stand up since. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  应该没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I don't think it's anything serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这应该是疝气   你得去看医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This sounds like a hernia. You have to-Go to the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算要去看医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I'm gonna go to the doctor for anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是因为肚子这里突出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it's gonna be for this thing sticking out of my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是疝气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a hernia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要恢复健身呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why'd I have to start working out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烂哑铃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn you, 15s.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（纽约大学）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们提早到了  还要十五分钟才会开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're a little early. The lecture doesn't end for 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   但我们可以偷偷溜进去看  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but we can sneak in and watch. Yeah. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  是姊妹会的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, look. There's some Kappa Kappa Deltas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前也是会员  嘿  姊妹们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was a Kappa. Hey, sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  我们以前真是犯贱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, we really are bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好   瑞格比  从实验室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. So when Rigby got his samples...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,取回样本后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...back from the laboratory...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有了惊人的发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...he made a startling discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他原以为那是火山物质   其实  是沉积物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What he believed to be igneous was, in fact, sedimentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的惊愕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Imagine his consternation when--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在搞什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很紧张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I was nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们害我担心  我会很无聊的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys had me all worried I was gonna be boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我上了台   学生都盯着我看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got up there and they were all, like, staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果我一开口  满嘴的英国腔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I opened my mouth and this British accent just came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还很锉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and not a very good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will you, please...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖勒博士   我是寇特拉斯曼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dr. Geller? Kurt Rathman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.92,0:11:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,古生物学系教授\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a professor in the paleontology department here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以聊聊你的课吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have a moment to talk about your lecture?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了   我和我妹妹有约\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, I've got plans with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.89,0:12:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡 盖勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  失陪一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Will you excuse us for one moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能装  我就不能装了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can have an accent, but I can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.98,0:12:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子  早啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Top of the morning to you, laddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别闹了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you just please stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个季节的孟买   气候非常怡人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bombay is very, very nice this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.37,0:12:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我点个小煎饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, will you grab me a cruller?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你去看医生  大哥  疝气手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will you go to the hospital? Dude, hernia operations cost, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该很贵吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a lot probably, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.27,0:12:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  它越来越黑  越来越痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Besides, it's getting darker and more painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:12:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就表示在好转\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That means it's healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我借你钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I will loan you the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快去医院  把它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just go to the hospital and let's just get that thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...pushed back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  但我要很久才能还你钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, but it'd take me forever to pay you that money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又不想惦记这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I don't want that hanging over my head, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  只要医保恢复\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Besides, as soon as my insurance kicks in...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就可以动各种免费手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I can get all the free operations I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打算先去做眼睛的雷射激光手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I'll probably start with that laser eye surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊的疝气很严重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Joey's got a bad hernia...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过动了个眼睛雷射手术就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but it's nothing a little laser eye surgery won't fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的   我跟你讲  把手压在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'm telling you, if I put my hand on my stomach right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.27,0:13:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就不痛了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it doesn't hurt that bad. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好你会死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, maybe you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   我怕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以一起走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, we can go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.99,0:13:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不要拖的太久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just don't wait too long, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为星期五之前我就会挂掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because I'm out of here sometime before Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不想死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  会很好玩的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以回来   吓吓他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can come back and we can haunt these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我  不要   这是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me them. No, they are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你偷我的  你才偷我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You stole them from me. You stole them from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要一人一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just wanna each take one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.35,0:14:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很公平   反正也没用过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that seems fair. We never use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你们真的得帮我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I really need some help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么   为什么我要说英国腔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why did I have to speak in a British accent?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢的把口音改掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, why don't you phase it out? Yeah, phase the accent out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别人会以为你在适应美国生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}People will think that you're adjusting to life in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  根本不会有人注意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I mean, come on. No one will even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.79,0:14:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好根本没人在听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, they're probably not even listening to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.25,0:14:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人在听我讲话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're not listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有在听你讲话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course they're listening to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.13,0:14:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都在听你讲话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everybody listens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮卡  你真的觉得我该慢慢改吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, do you really think I should try this phasing-out thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.55,0:14:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你很帅啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think you look fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:15:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  开始了  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whenever you're ready. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要给你一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've got a surprise...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惊喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停   抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold it. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个惊喜是一组新秋千  别演得这么凝重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The surprise is a new swing set. If you could play it less intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的   没问题   等我一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Sure, no problem. Just hold on one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  提米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要给你一个惊喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've got a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我都喂我的狗吃跑路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that's why I feed my dog Purina One.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天就去搬一包吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pick up a bag today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这时候你要把它搬起来  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's where you pick up the bag. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  台词是"搬一包"   所以你得把它搬起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, the line is, "Pick up a bag," so you need to pick up the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是用指的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or I could just point to it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:16:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑路   跑路  今天就去指一包吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Blah, blah, blah. Purina One. Point to a bag today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没过   对吧  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't get it, did I? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是乔伊崔比亚尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Joey Tribbiani.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来应征  "人"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm hereto audition for "Man."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"垂死的人" 吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean "Dying Man."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.18,0:16:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊   再打一次   真的要打  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, come on. Do it one more time. Really? Really? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.61,0:16:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你好  我是麦尼利博士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, this is Dr. McNeely...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来自假口音大学的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...from Fake Accent University.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想聘你来当专职教授\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'd like you to come on board with us full-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,预言错了   我不会死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My reading was wrong. I'm not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  你怎么知道   因为我的预言巫师死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? How do you know? Because my psychic is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一定是看错牌了  我很遗憾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She must have read the cards wrong. Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:16:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总比我死好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, better her than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我们来烤饼干吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, let's bake cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（银杯片厂）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你拿到这个角色  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I'm really glad you got the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的能演吗  能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure you can do this? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你陪我来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, hey, thanks for coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有谢谢你帮我洗澡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And thanks again for helping me take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样叫 "绝口不提"吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, is that "never talking about it again"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   都准备好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey. We're ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是亚历   他演你的儿子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, this is Alex. He's gonna be playing your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  亚历\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的手可没塞在裤子里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, as you can see, my hands are not in my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.85,0:17:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚历  当乔伊一说到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, uh, Alex. Now, when Joey says his line:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"好好照顾你妈"   你就要哭  懂吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Take good care of your mama, son," that's your cue to cry. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的   来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第五场   拍第一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Scene five, take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And action.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,儿子  好好照顾你妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take good care of your mama, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,儿子  好好照顾你妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take good care of your mama, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托啦  儿子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈是个好人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your mama's good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚历  记住  这里应该要哭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Alex, remember, you're supposed to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这次可以哭吗  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you cry for us this time? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  重来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. From the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第五场  拍第二次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Scene five, take two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.65,0:18:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拍第三十六次要来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take 36 is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再来一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.49,0:18:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   你好了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You ready, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.87,0:18:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请问一下  你喊"开始"前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, one thing, is it all right with you if I scream...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以大叫吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...right up until you say, "Action"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始  儿子   好好照顾你妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Action! Take good care of your mama, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cut. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  乔伊  你把衣服掀开来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Hey, hey. Joe, why don't you lift up your shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.51,0:19:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼你看这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take a look at this, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个小孩哭了  摄影机  快拍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have a crying child! Roll the damn cameras!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂   罗斯在吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello. Hello, is Ross there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不在   你要留言吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, he's not. Can I take a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好   我是罗斯的离婚律师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, this is Russell, Ross' divorce lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直没有他的回音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just tell him that since I haven't heard from him...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他应该是想试着经营这段婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I assume he's decided to give the marriage a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯又结婚了  不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross got married again? Aah! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.63,0:19:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   继续   慢慢改掉口音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, keep going. We are phasing the accent out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,改掉口音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phasing it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是进实验室重新化验结果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"So without retesting their results in the laboratory...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.51,0:19:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,研究小组也不会发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the team would never haveidenfified".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原先的碳14定年结果有误\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the initial errors in their carbon dating analysis."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到这里有问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Were there any questions at this point?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请说  你的口音怎么没了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. What's happening to your accent?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说一次  你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come again? What's this nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.21,0:20:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   我不是英国人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. I'm not English.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是长岛人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm from Long Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一紧张  就会冒出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was really nervous, and the accent...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个腔调了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...just, um-Just came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到课堂上来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So if we could just get back to the lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有任何问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, were there any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.69,0:20:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,古生物学的问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}About paleontology?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想留下良好的第一印象\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, look, I was just trying to make a good first impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.87,0:20:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很显然  我搞砸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Obviously, I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.91,0:20:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们对我的看法很重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But what you guys think of me is really important...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我想成为专职教授\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because I'm hoping to get a permanent job here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们愿意再给我一次机会  制造好感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So if you'd just give me another chance to make a good impression--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你疯了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross. Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.67,0:21:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是你的老婆  你想瞒我一辈子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am still your wife? What, were you just never gonna tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.22,0:21:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是哪里有病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真想宰了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, I could just kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, hello, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的玩过了  真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You've really done this before? Yeah. Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就用力打下去  用力  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just take a big, big swing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要手软\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,庆祝乔伊的医保恢复了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're just celebrating that Joey got his health insurance back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, all right.
